# AI-NETWORK-ASSISTANT

## Struktur
- Backend: FastAPI + Pydantic, satu file: backend/main.py
- Data: data/incident_result.json (dibaca langsung, tanpa database)
- Frontend: React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind (folder /frontend, baru dibuat)

## Cara run backend
- Backend (dari folder backend, venv aktif): python -m uvicorn main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
- Frontend (dari folder frontend): npm run dev

## Endpoint (semua GET)
- / -> {"message": "..."}
- /incidents -> list[Incident]
- /incidents/{incident_id} -> Incident, 404 {"detail": "Incident not found"} kalau tidak ada

## Schema Incident (semua field string)
incident_id, device_id, severity, anomaly_type, start_time, end_time,
root_cause, evidence, ai_analysis

## Contoh data (1 incident, ai_analysis dipotong)
{
  "incident_id": "INC-00001",
  "device_id": "R-004",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "anomaly_type": "traffic_spike",
  "start_time": "2026-09-06T14:00:00.000",
  "end_time": "2026-09-06T14:30:00.000",
  "root_cause": "Traffic Spike",
  "evidence": "Bandwidth averaged 96.02 over 7 telemetry events, while CPU usage averaged 34.83%.",
  "ai_analysis": "### 1. Summary\nBetween ... (dipotong, lihat catatan format di bawah)"
}

## Catatan format data (penting buat frontend)
- ai_analysis adalah teks MARKDOWN (heading ###, bullet, bold, garis ---) dengan 6 bagian:
  Summary, Evidence, Likely Cause, Potential Impact, Diagnostic Recommendations, Evidence Limitation.
  Render pakai react-markdown, jangan tampilkan sebagai teks mentah.
- start_time/end_time: string ISO tanpa timezone. Tampilkan apa adanya (format saja),
  jangan konversi timezone.
- severity yang sudah terlihat: HIGH, CRITICAL. Kemungkinan ada MEDIUM/LOW. Badge harus punya warna default.
- Data di JSON tidak terurut waktu. Sort di frontend.
- Bandwidth tidak punya satuan. Jangan tulis Mbps/Gbps di UI.
- evidence itu satu kalimat pendek, cocok buat kolom ringkasan di tabel.

